  "note": "Stress kitchen sink (corpus/stress/kitchen-sink): one large all-variety page combining every small-fixture theme into a single document — a fixed navbar (flex + z-index stacking + nested dropdown list), a hero with a floating z-indexed badge, a card grid (grid tracks + flex-column cards with border / border-radius / box-shadow / background), a two-column media-query split (an RTL section and an LTR text article with blockquote, bulleted list, whole-block letter-spacing, and white-space:pre), a styled form (labels + explicit-height inputs + a submit control), and a footer — all on a propagated body background. Rendered at 320x568, 360x640, and 1280x800 with four-layer Chrome parity; exercises deep nesting, flex+grid mix, shadows, opacity, borders, border-radius, calc(), pseudo-elements, and media queries together.",
